  "name": "aom_singlepass_pickoff",
  "description": "780 nm single-pass AOM switch with power monitor (after PyOpticL's singlepass module). A 5% sampler picks off light to a photodiode for intensity stabilisation. Lens 1 (f=100 mm) focuses into a 200 MHz AOM (w0 \u2248 60 \u00b5m \u2192 ~10 ns rise time); lens 2 (f=250 mm), centred on the +1 order one focal length after the AOM, recollimates it (w \u2248 1.1 mm) for a PAF2-11B fiber port. The 0th order is 8.5 mm away after 230 mm and is caught by a beam dump before lens 2.",
